        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u4E00\u65E6\u60A8\u7684\u8FDB\u5EA6\u88AB\u91CD\u7F6E\uFF0C\u5C06\u65E0\u6CD5\u6062\u590D\u3002"
          - Key: 10
            Value: Once your progress is reset, it won't be possible to restore it.
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Une fois votre progression r\xE9initialis\xE9e, il ne sera plus
              possible de la restaurer."
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Sobald Ihr Fortschritt zur\xFCckgesetzt wurde, kann er nicht
              mehr wiederhergestellt werden."
          - Key: 20
            Value: Setelah kemajuan Anda diatur ulang, tidak mungkin untuk memulihkannya.
          - Key: 21
            Value: "Una volta azzerati i progressi, non sar\xE0 pi\xF9 possibile
              ripristinarli."
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u4E00\u5EA6\u9032\u884C\u72B6\u6CC1\u304C\u30EA\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\u3055\u308C\u308B\u3068\u3001
              \u5FA9\u5143\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3067\u304D\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uC9C4\uD589 \uC0C1\uD669\uC774 \uCD08\uAE30\uD654\uB418\uBA74
              \uB354 \uC774\uC0C1 \uBCF5\uAD6C\uD560 \uC218 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Depois que seu progresso for reiniciado, n\xE3o ser\xE1 poss\xEDvel
              restaur\xE1-lo."
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u041F\u043E\u0441\u043B\u0435 \u0441\u0431\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0430
