        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u7C7B\u522B\u4E00\u65E6\u5220\u9664\uFF0C\u5C06\u65E0\u6CD5\u6062\u590D\u3002"
          - Key: 10
            Value: Once a category is deleted, it cannot be restored.
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Une fois qu'une cat\xE9gorie est supprim\xE9e, elle ne peut pas
              \xEAtre restaur\xE9e."
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Sobald eine Kategorie gel\xF6scht wurde, kann sie nicht wiederhergestellt
              werden."
          - Key: 20
            Value: Setelah suatu kategori dihapus, kategori itu tidak dapat dikembalikan
              lagi.
          - Key: 21
            Value: "Una volta eliminata una categoria, non \xE8 pi\xF9 possibile
              ripristinarla."
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u30AB\u30C6\u30B4\u30EA\u3092\u524A\u9664\u3059\u308B\u3068\u3001
              \u5FA9\u5143\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\u3067\u304D\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uB97C \uC0AD\uC81C\uD558\uBA74 \uBCF5\uAD6C\uD560
              \uC218 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Depois que uma categoria \xE9 exclu\xEDda, ela n\xE3o pode ser
              restaurada."
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u041F\u043E\u0441\u043B\u0435 \u0443\u0434\u0430\u043B\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F
