          - Key: 14
            Value: Choisissez votre niveau
          - Key: 15
            Value: "W\xE4hlen Sie Ihr Niveau"
          - Key: 20
            Value: Pilih level Anda
          - Key: 21
            Value: Scegli il tuo livello
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u30EC\u30D9\u30EB\u3092\u9078\u629E\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uB808\uBCA8\uC744 \uC120\uD0DD\uD558\uC138\uC694"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Escolha seu n\xEDvel"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0412\u044B\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0439
              \u0443\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435\u043D\u044C"
          - Key: 34
            Value: Elige tu nivel
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E40\u0E25\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E01\u0E23\u0E30\u0E14\u0E31\u0E1A\u0E02\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13"
    - Key: fa243973-5aaa-49fa-8023-9ea71b0b60d0
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.how-many-words
        <GUID>k__BackingField: fa243973-5aaa-49fa-8023-9ea71b0b60d0
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u4F60\u6BCF\u5929\u60F3\u5B66\u591A\u5C11\u4E2A\u5355\u8BCD\uFF1F"
          - Key: 10
            Value: How many words a day do you want to learn?
          - Key: 14
            Value: Combien de mots par jour souhaitez-vous apprendre ?
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Wie viele W\xF6rter m\xF6chten Sie pro Tag lernen?"
          - Key: 20
            Value: Berapa banyak kata yang ingin Anda pelajari setiap hari?
          - Key: 21
            Value: Quante parole al giorno vuoi imparare?
          - Key: 22
            Value: "1\u65E5\u306B\u4F55\u8A9E\u5B66\u3073\u305F\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B?"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uD558\uB8E8\uC5D0 \uBA87 \uAC1C\uC758 \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C \uBC30\uC6B0\uACE0
              \uC2F6\uC73C\uC2E0\uAC00\uC694?"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Quantas palavras por dia voc\xEA quer aprender?"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0421\u043A\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432
              \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u043D\u044C \u0442\u044B \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0448\u044C
              \u0443\u0447\u0438\u0442\u044C?"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "\xBFCu\xE1ntas palabras al d\xEDa quieres aprender?"
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E32\u0E01\u0E40\u0E23\u0E35\u0E22\u0E19\u0E04\u0E33\u0E28\u0E31\u0E1E\u0E17\u0E4C\u0E01\u0E35\u0E48\u0E04\u0E33\u0E15\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E27\u0E31\u0E19?"
    - Key: b723dd03-78fc-4679-8722-3016ed9a737a
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.so-many-words
        <GUID>k__BackingField: b723dd03-78fc-4679-8722-3016ed9a737a
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u4E00\u4E2A\u6708\u5185\u4F60\u5C06\u4F1A\u5B66\u5230\u5F88\u591A\u5355\u8BCD\uFF01"
          - Key: 10
            Value: You will learn so many words in a month!
          - Key: 14
            Value: Vous apprendrez tellement de mots en un mois !
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Sie werden in einem Monat so viele W\xF6rter lernen!"
          - Key: 20
            Value: Anda akan mempelajari banyak kata dalam sebulan!
          - Key: 21
            Value: Imparerai tantissime parole in un mese!
          - Key: 22
            Value: "1 \u304B\u6708\u3067\u305F\u304F\u3055\u3093\u306E\u5358\u8A9E\u3092\u5B66\u3079\u307E\u3059!"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uD55C \uB2EC\uC774\uBA74 \uC815\uB9D0 \uB9CE\uC740 \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C
              \uBC30\uC6B8 \uC218 \uC788\uC744 \uAC70\uC608\uC694!"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Voc\xEA aprender\xE1 muitas palavras em um m\xEAs!"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0421\u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C\u043A\u043E \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432
              \u0442\u044B \u0432\u044B\u0443\u0447\u0438\u0448\u044C \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0437
              \u043C\u0435\u0441\u044F\u0446!"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "\xA1Aprender\xE1s muchas palabras en un mes!"
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E08\u0E30\u0E40\u0E23\u0E35\u0E22\u0E19\u0E23\u0E39\u0E49\u0E04\u0E33\u0E28\u0E31\u0E1E\u0E17\u0E4C\u0E21\u0E32\u0E01\u0E21\u0E32\u0E22\u0E20\u0E32\u0E22\u0E43\u0E19\u0E2B\u0E19\u0E36\u0E48\u0E07\u0E40\u0E14\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E19!"
