    - Key: fb489f70-153c-4e72-865e-cc512f2d9292
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.lets-start
        <GUID>k__BackingField: fb489f70-153c-4e72-865e-cc512f2d9292
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u8BA9\u6211\u4EEC\u4ECE\u5B66\u4E60\u5355\u8BCD\u5F00\u59CB\u5427\uFF01"
          - Key: 10
            Value: Let's start by learning words!
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Commen\xE7ons par apprendre des mots !"
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Beginnen wir mit dem Lernen von W\xF6rtern!"
          - Key: 20
            Value: Mari kita mulai dengan mempelajari kata-kata!
          - Key: 21
            Value: Cominciamo imparando le parole!
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u307E\u305A\u306F\u5358\u8A9E\u306E\u5B66\u7FD2\u304B\u3089\u59CB\u3081\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C \uBC30\uC6B0\uB294 \uAC83\uBD80\uD130 \uC2DC\uC791\uD574
              \uBCFC\uAE4C\uC694!"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Vamos come\xE7ar aprendendo palavras!"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0414\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0439 \u043D\u0430\u0447\u043D\u0435\u043C
              \u0441 \u0438\u0437\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432!"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "\xA1Comencemos aprendiendo palabras!"
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E21\u0E32\u0E40\u0E23\u0E34\u0E48\u0E21\u0E15\u0E49\u0E19\u0E14\u0E49\u0E27\u0E22\u0E01\u0E32\u0E23\u0E40\u0E23\u0E35\u0E22\u0E19\u0E23\u0E39\u0E49\u0E04\u0E33\u0E28\u0E31\u0E1E\u0E17\u0E4C\u0E01\u0E31\u0E19\u0E01\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19!"
    - Key: bf487692-df00-48d0-b907-2bcce91c5588
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.press-to-see
        <GUID>k__BackingField: bf487692-df00-48d0-b907-2bcce91c5588
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u70B9\u51FB\u6309\u94AE\n\u67E5\u770B\u5355\u8BCD\u7684\u7FFB\u8BD1"
          - Key: 10
            Value: 'Click the button to

              see the translation of the
              word'
          - Key: 14
            Value: Cliquez sur le bouton pour voir la traduction du mot.
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Klicken Sie auf die Schaltfl\xE4che, um die \xDCbersetzung des
              Wortes anzuzeigen."
          - Key: 20
            Value: 'Klik tombol untuk

              melihat terjemahan kata tersebut'
          - Key: 21
            Value: 'Clicca sul pulsante per

              vedere la traduzione della
              parola'
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u30DC\u30BF\u30F3\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30C3\u30AF\u3059\u308B\u3068\n\u5358\u8A9E\u306E\u7FFB\u8A33\u304C\u8868\u793A\u3055\u308C\u307E\u3059"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uBC84\uD2BC\uC744 \uD074\uB9AD\uD558\uC5EC\n\uB2E8\uC5B4\uC758
              \uBC88\uC5ED\uC744 \uD655\uC778\uD558\uC138\uC694"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Clique no bot\xE3o para\nver a tradu\xE7\xE3o da palavra"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u041D\u0430\u0436\u043C\u0438 \u043D\u0430 \u043A\u043D\u043E\u043F\u043A\u0443,
              \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B\n\u0443\u0432\u0438\u0434\u0435\u0442\u044C
              \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u043E\u0434 \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0430"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "Haga clic en el bot\xF3n para ver la traducci\xF3n de la palabra."
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E04\u0E25\u0E34\u0E01\u0E1B\u0E38\u0E48\u0E21\u0E40\u0E1E\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E14\u0E39\u0E04\u0E33\u0E41\u0E1B\u0E25\u0E02\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E04\u0E33"
    - Key: d610dd5e-c73a-4ae0-afd8-8cccf75f553c
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.swipe-if-know
        <GUID>k__BackingField: d610dd5e-c73a-4ae0-afd8-8cccf75f553c
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u5DF2\u7ECF\u8BA4\u8BC6\u8FD9\u4E2A\u5355\u8BCD\uFF0C\n\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u5411\u5DE6\u6ED1\u52A8\u3002"
          - Key: 10
            Value: 'If you already know this word,

              you can swipe it
              left.'
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Si vous connaissez d\xE9j\xE0 ce mot,\nvous pouvez le faire glisser
              vers la gauche."
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Wenn Sie dieses Wort bereits kennen,\nk\xF6nnen Sie es nach links
              wischen."
          - Key: 20
            Value: 'Jika Anda sudah tahu kata ini,

              Anda dapat menggesernya
              ke kiri.'
          - Key: 21
            Value: "Se conosci gi\xE0 questa parola,\npuoi scorrerla verso sinistra."
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u3053\u306E\u5358\u8A9E\u3092\u3059\u3067\u306B\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5834\u5408\u306F\u3001
              \n\u5DE6\u306B\u30B9\u30EF\u30A4\u30D7\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uC774\uBBF8 \uC774 \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C \uC54C\uACE0 \uC788\uB2E4\uBA74\n\uC67C\uCABD\uC73C\uB85C
              \uC2A4\uC640\uC774\uD504\uD558\uC138\uC694."
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Se voc\xEA j\xE1 conhece essa palavra,\nvoc\xEA pode deslizar
              para a esquerda."
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u044B \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u0437\u043D\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C
              \u044D\u0442\u043E \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432\u043E,\n\u0442\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C
              \u0441\u043C\u0430\u0445\u043D\u0443\u0442\u044C \u0435\u0433\u043E
              \u0432\u043B\u0435\u0432\u043E"
          - Key: 34
            Value: Si ya conoces esta palabra, puedes deslizarla hacia la izquierda.
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E01\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E23\u0E39\u0E49\u0E08\u0E31\u0E01\u0E04\u0E33\u0E19\u0E35\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E39\u0E48\u0E41\u0E25\u0E49\u0E27
              \u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E2A\u0E32\u0E21\u0E32\u0E23\u0E16\u0E1B\u0E31\u0E14\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E17\u0E32\u0E07\u0E0B\u0E49\u0E32\u0E22\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49"
    - Key: 87b9ab18-8d63-4a82-b628-6be482819f3e
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.hide
        <GUID>k__BackingField: 87b9ab18-8d63-4a82-b628-6be482819f3e
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u5982\u679C\u4F60\u4E0D\u60F3\u5B66\u4E60\u8FD9\u4E2A\u5355\u8BCD\uFF0C\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u9690\u85CF\u5B83\u3002"
          - Key: 10
            Value: If you don't want to learn this word, you can hide it.
          - Key: 14
            Value: Si vous ne voulez pas apprendre ce mot, vous pouvez le cacher.
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Wenn Sie dieses Wort nicht lernen m\xF6chten, k\xF6nnen Sie es
              ausblenden."
          - Key: 20
            Value: Jika Anda tidak ingin mempelajari kata ini, Anda dapat menyembunyikannya.
          - Key: 21
            Value: Se non vuoi imparare questa parola, puoi nasconderla.
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u3053\u306E\u5358\u8A9E\u3092\u5B66\u7FD2\u3057\u305F\u304F\u306A\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306F\u3001
              \u975E\u8868\u793A\u306B\u3059\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304C\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uC774 \uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C \uBC30\uC6B0\uACE0 \uC2F6\uC9C0 \uC54A\uB2E4\uBA74
              \uC228\uAE30\uBA74 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Se voc\xEA n\xE3o quiser aprender essa palavra, voc\xEA pode
              escond\xEA-la."
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u044B \u043D\u0435 \u0445\u043E\u0447\u0435\u0448\u044C
              \u0438\u0437\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044C \u044D\u0442\u043E\n\u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432\u043E,
              \u0442\u044B \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C \u0435\u0433\u043E
              \u0441\u043A\u0440\u044B\u0442\u044C"
          - Key: 34
            Value: Si no quieres aprender esta palabra, puedes ocultarla.
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E01\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E44\u0E21\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E22\u0E32\u0E01\u0E40\u0E23\u0E35\u0E22\u0E19\u0E23\u0E39\u0E49\u0E04\u0E33\u0E19\u0E35\u0E49
              \u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E2A\u0E32\u0E21\u0E32\u0E23\u0E16\u0E0B\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E19\u0E21\u0E31\u0E19\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49"
    - Key: e81cd29b-9023-43da-8938-13ac9e546b26
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.swipe-to-start-learn
        <GUID>k__BackingField: e81cd29b-9023-43da-8938-13ac9e546b26
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u8981\u5F00\u59CB\u5B66\u4E60\u5355\u8BCD\uFF0C\u8BF7\u5411\u53F3\u6ED1\u52A8\u3002"
          - Key: 10
            Value: To start learning a word, swipe it right.
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Pour commencer \xE0 apprendre un mot, faites-le glisser vers
              la droite."
          - Key: 15
            Value: Um mit dem Lernen eines Wortes zu beginnen, wischen Sie es nach
              rechts.
          - Key: 20
            Value: Untuk mulai mempelajari suatu kata, geser ke kanan.
          - Key: 21
            Value: Per iniziare a imparare una parola, scorrila verso destra.
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u5358\u8A9E\u306E\u5B66\u7FD2\u3092\u59CB\u3081\u308B\u306B\u306F\u3001
              \u53F3\u306B\u30B9\u30EF\u30A4\u30D7\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C \uBC30\uC6B0\uB824\uBA74 \uC624\uB978\uCABD\uC73C\uB85C
              \uC2A4\uC640\uC774\uD504\uD558\uC138\uC694."
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Para come\xE7ar a aprender uma palavra, deslize-a para a direita."
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0427\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043D\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044C
              \u0438\u0437\u0443\u0447\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435\n\u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0430
              \u0441\u043C\u0430\u0445\u043D\u0438 \u0435\u0433\u043E \u0432\u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043E"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "Para comenzar a aprender una palabra, desl\xEDcela hacia la derecha."
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E01\u0E15\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E01\u0E32\u0E23\u0E40\u0E23\u0E34\u0E48\u0E21\u0E40\u0E23\u0E35\u0E22\u0E19\u0E23\u0E39\u0E49\u0E04\u0E33\u0E28\u0E31\u0E1E\u0E17\u0E4C
              \u0E43\u0E2B\u0E49\u0E1B\u0E31\u0E14\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E17\u0E32\u0E07\u0E02\u0E27\u0E32"
    - Key: 4ab6d3d3-e294-448c-b0d1-30047e9aee9c
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.interval-start
        <GUID>k__BackingField: 4ab6d3d3-e294-448c-b0d1-30047e9aee9c
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u5F53\u4F60\u5411\u53F3\u6ED1\u52A8\u4E00\u4E2A\u5355\u8BCD\u65F6\n\u95F4\u9694\u91CD\u590D\u7B97\u6CD5\u5C31\u4F1A\u5F00\u59CB\u3002"
          - Key: 10
            Value: 'When you swipe a word

              to the right, the spaced
              repetition algorithm begins.'
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Lorsque vous faites glisser un mot vers la droite, l'algorithme
              de r\xE9p\xE9tition espac\xE9e d\xE9marre."
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Wenn Sie ein Wort nach rechts wischen, wird der Algorithmus f\xFCr
              die verteilte Wiederholung gestartet."
          - Key: 20
            Value: 'Saat Anda menggeser kata

              ke kanan, algoritma pengulangan
              spasi dimulai.'
          - Key: 21
            Value: 'Quando scorri una parola

              verso destra, inizia
              l''algoritmo di ripetizione dilazionata.'
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u5358\u8A9E\u3092\u53F3\u306B\u30B9\u30EF\u30A4\u30D7\u3059\u308B\u3068\n\u9593\u9694\u53CD\u5FA9\u30A2\u30EB\u30B4\u30EA\u30BA\u30E0\u304C\u59CB\u307E\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3002"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uB2E8\uC5B4\uB97C \uC624\uB978\uCABD\uC73C\uB85C \uC2A4\uC640\uC774\uD504\uD558\uBA74\n\uAC04\uACA9
              \uBC18\uBCF5 \uC54C\uACE0\uB9AC\uC998\uC774 \uC2DC\uC791\uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Quando voc\xEA desliza uma palavra\npara a direita, o algoritmo
              de repeti\xE7\xE3o espa\xE7ada come\xE7a."
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u041A\u043E\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u0442\u044B \u0441\u043C\u0430\u0445\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C
              \u0441\u043B\u043E\u0432\u043E\n\u0432 \u043F\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043E
              \u043D\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043D\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F \u0430\u043B\u0433\u043E\u0440\u0438\u0442\u043C\n\u0441
              \u0438\u043D\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0432\u0430\u043B\u044C\u043D\u044B\u043C
              \u043F\u043E\u0432\u0442\u043E\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435\u043C"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "Cuando deslizas una palabra hacia la derecha, comienza el algoritmo
              de repetici\xF3n espaciada."
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E40\u0E21\u0E37\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E1B\u0E31\u0E14\u0E04\u0E33\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E17\u0E32\u0E07\u0E02\u0E27\u0E32
              \u0E2D\u0E31\u0E25\u0E01\u0E2D\u0E23\u0E34\u0E17\u0E36\u0E21\u0E01\u0E32\u0E23\u0E17\u0E33\u0E0B\u0E49\u0E33\u0E41\u0E1A\u0E1A\u0E40\u0E27\u0E49\u0E19\u0E23\u0E30\u0E22\u0E30\u0E2B\u0E48\u0E32\u0E07\u0E08\u0E30\u0E40\u0E23\u0E34\u0E48\u0E21\u0E15\u0E49\u0E19\u0E02\u0E36\u0E49\u0E19"
    - Key: d44192a3-8792-44c3-acd5-7ea17ab814d9
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.open-by-one-character
        <GUID>k__BackingField: d44192a3-8792-44c3-acd5-7ea17ab814d9
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u5982\u679C\u60A8\u6709\u7591\u95EE\uFF0C\u53EF\u4EE5\u4E00\u6B21\u6253\u5F00\u4E00\u4E2A\u5B57\u6BCD\u3002"
          - Key: 10
            Value: If you're in doubt, you can open it one letter at a time.
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Si vous avez un doute, vous pouvez l'ouvrir une lettre \xE0 la
              fois."
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Wenn Sie Zweifel haben, k\xF6nnen Sie es Buchstabe f\xFCr Buchstabe
              \xF6ffnen."
          - Key: 20
            Value: Jika Anda ragu, Anda dapat membukanya satu huruf dalam satu waktu.
          - Key: 21
            Value: In caso di dubbi, puoi aprirla una lettera alla volta.
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u7591\u554F\u304C\u3042\u308B\u5834\u5408\u306F\u3001 1 \u6587\u5B57\u305A\u3064\u958B\u3051\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uC758\uC2EC\uC2A4\uB7EC\uC6B0\uC2DC\uB2E4\uBA74, \uD55C \uBC88\uC5D0
              \uD55C \uAE00\uC790\uC529 \uC5F4\uC5B4\uBCF4\uC2DC\uBA74 \uB429\uB2C8\uB2E4."
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Se tiver d\xFAvidas, voc\xEA pode abrir uma letra de cada vez."
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0415\u0441\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u044B \u0441\u043E\u043C\u043D\u0435\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0448\u044C\u0441\u044F,
              \u0442\u044B\n\u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C \u043E\u0442\u043A\u0440\u044B\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C
              \u043F\u043E 1 \u0431\u0443\u043A\u0432\u0435"
          - Key: 34
            Value: Si tienes dudas, puedes abrirla letra por letra.
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E01\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E21\u0E35\u0E02\u0E49\u0E2D\u0E2A\u0E07\u0E2A\u0E31\u0E22
              \u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E2A\u0E32\u0E21\u0E32\u0E23\u0E16\u0E40\u0E1B\u0E34\u0E14\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49\u0E17\u0E35\u0E25\u0E30\u0E15\u0E31\u0E27\u0E2D\u0E31\u0E01\u0E29\u0E23"
    - Key: c859861e-4bba-4243-85b3-ca1b52f14676
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.select-from-four
        <GUID>k__BackingField: c859861e-4bba-4243-85b3-ca1b52f14676
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u6216\u8005\u4F60\u53EF\u4EE5\u5C1D\u8BD5\n\u4ECE 4 \u4E2A\u9009\u9879\u4E2D\u9009\u62E9"
          - Key: 10
            Value: 'Or you can try

              choosing from 4 options'
          - Key: 14
            Value: 'Ou vous pouvez essayer

              de choisir parmi 4 options'
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Oder w\xE4hlen Sie aus vier Optionen"
          - Key: 20
            Value: 'Atau Anda dapat mencoba

              memilih dari 4 pilihan'
          - Key: 21
            Value: 'Oppure puoi provare

              a scegliere tra 4 opzioni'
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u307E\u305F\u306F\u3001 4\u3064\u306E\u30AA\u30D7\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u304B\u3089\n\u304A\u9078\u3073\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304F\u3053\u3068\u3082\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uC544\uB2C8\uBA74\n4\uAC00\uC9C0 \uC635\uC158 \uC911\uC5D0\uC11C
              \uC120\uD0DD\uD574 \uBCF4\uC138\uC694"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Ou voc\xEA pode tentar\nescolher entre 4 op\xE7\xF5es"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0418\u043B\u0438 \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0448\u044C \u043F\u043E\u043F\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C\n\u0432\u044B\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C
              \u0438\u0437 4 \u0432\u0430\u0440\u0438\u0430\u043D\u0442\u043E\u0432"
          - Key: 34
            Value: 'O puedes probar

              eligiendo entre 4 opciones'
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E2B\u0E23\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E2D\u0E32\u0E08\u0E25\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E40\u0E25\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E01\u0E08\u0E32\u0E01
              4 \u0E15\u0E31\u0E27\u0E40\u0E25\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E01"
    - Key: 57810413-8190-437c-a7f9-09e042c5a535
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.lets-start-practice
        <GUID>k__BackingField: 57810413-8190-437c-a7f9-09e042c5a535
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u4F60\u505A\u5F97\u5F88\u597D\uFF0C\n\u6211\u4EEC\u5F00\u59CB\u7EC3\u4E60\u5427\uFF01"
          - Key: 10
            Value: 'You''re doing great,

              let''s start practicing!'
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Tu t'en sors tr\xE8s bien,\nCommen\xE7ons \xE0 nous entra\xEEner\_!"
          - Key: 15
            Value: "Du machst das super, \nlass uns anfangen zu \xFCben!"
          - Key: 20
            Value: 'Kamu hebat,

              Ayo mulai berlatih!'
          - Key: 21
            Value: 'Stai andando alla grande,

              iniziamo ad allenarci!'
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u7D20\u6674\u3089\u3057\u3044\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002 \n\u7DF4\u7FD2\u3092\u59CB\u3081\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uC798\uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uC5B4\uC694.\n\uC5F0\uC2B5\uC744 \uC2DC\uC791\uD574
              \uBCFC\uAE4C\uC694!"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Voc\xEA est\xE1 indo muito bem,\nvamos come\xE7ar a praticar!"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0423 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F \u0445\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0448\u043E
              \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044F,\n\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0439
              \u043D\u0430\u0447\u043D\u0435\u043C \u043F\u0440\u0430\u043A\u0442\u0438\u043A\u0443!"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "Lo est\xE1s haciendo genial. \xA1Comencemos a practicar!"
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E04\u0E38\u0E13\u0E17\u0E33\u0E44\u0E14\u0E49\u0E14\u0E35\u0E21\u0E32\u0E01\n\u0E21\u0E32\u0E40\u0E23\u0E34\u0E48\u0E21\u0E1D\u0E36\u0E01\u0E01\u0E31\u0E19\u0E40\u0E25\u0E22!"
    - Key: 5191c09c-2957-4826-8231-2300378e159e
      Value:
        <Key>k__BackingField: ui.onboarding.choose-categories
        <GUID>k__BackingField: 5191c09c-2957-4826-8231-2300378e159e
        <TableName>k__BackingField: onboarding
        <Translations>k__BackingField:
          _serializedList:
          - Key: 6
            Value: "\u9009\u62E9\u7C7B\u522B\u7136\u540E\u5F00\u59CB\u5427\uFF01"
          - Key: 10
            Value: Choose categories and let's get started!
          - Key: 14
            Value: "Choisissez les cat\xE9gories et commen\xE7ons !"
          - Key: 15
            Value: "W\xE4hlen Sie Kategorien und los geht's!"
          - Key: 20
            Value: Pilih kategori dan mari kita mulai!
          - Key: 21
            Value: Scegli le categorie e cominciamo!
          - Key: 22
            Value: "\u30AB\u30C6\u30B4\u30EA\u30FC\u3092\u9078\u629E\u3057\u3066\u59CB\u3081\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01"
          - Key: 23
            Value: "\uCE74\uD14C\uACE0\uB9AC\uB97C \uC120\uD0DD\uD558\uACE0 \uC2DC\uC791\uD574
              \uBCF4\uC138\uC694!"
          - Key: 28
            Value: "Escolha categorias e vamos come\xE7ar!"
          - Key: 30
            Value: "\u0412\u044B\u0431\u0435\u0440\u0438 \u043A\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0433\u043E\u0440\u0438\u0438
              \u0438 \u043D\u0430\u0447\u043D\u0435\u043C!"
          - Key: 34
            Value: "\xA1Elige categor\xEDas y comencemos!"
          - Key: 36
            Value: "\u0E40\u0E25\u0E37\u0E2D\u0E01\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E27\u0E14\u0E2B\u0E21\u0E39\u0E48\u0E41\u0E25\u0E30\u0E40\u0E23\u0E34\u0E48\u0E21\u0E15\u0E49\u0E19\u0E01\u0E31\u0E19\u0E40\u0E25\u0E22!"
